{
  "schemaVersion": "1.1.0",
  "id": "grafana-quickpizza-working-filters",
  "title": "Build a dashboard with dependent filters",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Build and save a QuickPizza dashboard with dependent environment and service filters, then reopen it to check the corrected query and selections persist. The observed HTTP services are quickpizza-catalog, quickpizza-config, quickpizza-copy, quickpizza-public-api, and quickpizza-recommendations. Only production was observed, so this demo cannot prove filtering across multiple environments. Dashboard variables do not apply to alert rules."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Install QuickPizza or open its existing dashboards without resetting the demo."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "install",
      "title": "Install QuickPizza",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "step-01",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/a/grafana-demodashboards-app",
          "requirements": [],
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Open Demo Data Dashboards",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true,
          "tooltip": "Open Demo Data Dashboards."
        },
        {
          "id": "step-02",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid=\"install-quickpizza\"], [data-testid=\"view-quickpizza\"]",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/a/grafana-demodashboards-app",
            "min-version:13.3.0"
          ],
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Install QuickPizza, or open its dashboards when already installed",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true,
          "verify": "on-page:/dashboards/f/grafana-demodashboards-quickpizza",
          "tooltip": "Install QuickPizza, or open its dashboards when already installed."
        }
      ],
      "requirements": []
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "QuickPizza provides real HTTP traffic for the dashboard you will build."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Create an environment query variable from QuickPizza HTTP labels and configure its selection behavior."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "environment",
      "title": "Create environment filter",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "step-03",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/dashboard/new?from=now-1h&to=now",
          "requirements": [],
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Create a separate dashboard",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true,
          "tooltip": "Create a separate dashboard."
        },
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "id": "name-environment",
          "content": "Add a Query variable named environment.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "id": "step-04",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.Sidebar.addNewVariableButton}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Add a variable",
              "tooltip": "Add a variable."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-05",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.ElementEditPane.variableType:query} button",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Choose Query",
              "tooltip": "Choose Query."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-06",
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.ElementEditPane.variableNameInput}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Name the variable environment",
              "targetvalue": "environment",
              "tooltip": "Name the variable environment."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "id": "query-environment",
          "content": "Configure and preview the environment query, then apply it.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "id": "step-07",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:pages.Dashboard.Settings.Variables.Edit.QueryVariable.queryOptionsOpenButton}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Open the query editor",
              "tooltip": "Open the query editor."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-08",
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.DataSourcePicker.inputV2}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Select grafanacloud-play-prom",
              "targetvalue": "grafanacloud-play-prom",
              "tooltip": "Select grafanacloud-play-prom."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-09",
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.DataSource.Prometheus.variableQueryEditor.queryType} input",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
