    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Referencing `${environment:regex}` makes service options dependent on environment; an empty **Custom all value** expands the available options, while disabling **Allow custom values** prevents arbitrary labels."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Build a time series panel that interpolates the selected environments and services into PromQL."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "traffic",
      "title": "Build the traffic panel",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "id": "create-panel",
          "content": "Add a panel, select the demo data source, and use Code mode.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "id": "step-35",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:pages.Dashboard.Sidebar.addButton}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new",
                "min-version:13.3.0"
              ],
              "description": "Open Add",
              "tooltip": "Open Add."
            },
            {
              "id": "step-36",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.Sidebar.newPanelButton}",
              "requirements": [
