    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "`=~` matches the expression produced by `:regex`, supporting single, multiple, and All selections."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Introduce a hardcoded matcher, inspect the request, and repair the filter."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "repair",
      "title": "Inspect and repair a broken filter",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "id": "step-46",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.General.content} [role=\"textbox\"][aria-label^=\"Editor content\"]",
          "content": "Introduce a hardcoded public-api filter",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new",
            "min-version:13.3.0"
